WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Welcome to the lesson on thin lenses. A converging lens brings parallel rays of light together at the focal point.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The distance from the lens to that point is the focal length.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The lens form your links to the object distance, the image distance, and the focal length.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.000
1 over f equals 1 over u plus 1 over v magnification is the image distance divided by the object distance.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Try the free exercises at the end before the next lesson.
